Package: verdict
Title: Flexible Evaluation of Multiclass Classification Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Thelma", "Panaïotis", , "thelma.panaiotis.pub@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extends the yardstick package with a classification_report()
    function that returns per-class precision, recall, F1-score, and support,
    along with macro and weighted averages. Also provides single-value
    precision(), recall(), and f1_meas() functions matching yardstick's
    output format. Supports excluding specific classes from average
    computations, motivated by imbalanced multiclass problems such as
    plankton image classification where a dominant "detritus" class biases
    aggregate metrics.
